/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 91 0 R
/T (BLEL Trading PLC is a trusted Ethiopian trading company dedicated to connecting local agricultural producers with international markets. We specialize in the export of high-quality grains and pulses, delivering products that meet global standards while creating lasting value for our customers and partners. Our export portfolio includes green mung beans, chickpeas, sesame seeds, lentils, and a variety of other agricultural commodities sourced from reliable producers across Ethiopia. Every product is carefully selected, processed and handled to ensure consistent quality, freshness, and traceability. In addition to grains we export salt and Cattle.)
/E (BLEL Trading PLC is a trusted Ethiopian trading company dedicated to connecting local agricultural producers with international markets. We specialize in the export of high-quality grains and pulses, delivering products that meet global standards while creating lasting value for our customers and partners. Our export portfolio includes green mung beans, chickpeas, sesame seeds, lentils, and a variety of other agricultural commodities sourced from reliable producers across Ethiopia. Every product is carefully selected, processed and handled to ensure consistent quality, freshness, and traceability. In addition to grains we export salt and Cattle.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
